Seeds can be obtained from several bosses, such as the [[Skeletal mystic]]s, [[Lizardmen shaman]]s, and [[Guardian (Chambers of Xeric)|Guardian statues]]. They can also be found by raking [[weeds (Chambers of Xeric)|weeds]] in the top and lower floors (the last area in those floors and the first area in the lower floor).

There are two farming plots in each resource room for players to grow herbs. Due to the magic of the chambers, herbs grow faster and are fully grown in 30 seconds.
